# The exact denial each document in connector-egress-cross-site.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
NetworkPolicy cloudflare-public/cloudflared-naranjo-online is outside the exact DNS, edge, and site egress allowlist
